   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!--facs="berlin"-->
            <ab xml:id="MP0406_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>plykˈ Y PWN nmywl dʾlyk
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>ẔNH BYRḤ ʾrṭwhšt Y
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>ŠNṬ $-X-III-(III-III) (l)wcyk
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>lʾd ŠG G-III ʿL
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>dʾṭynˈ Y hmwckˈ Y
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>ʾnblkʾn ʾDYN LʾWḤL YḤBWNṭˈ
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>zʾṭʾnplhwˈ ḤṬYMWNṭ ○
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0406_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>Friyag ī pad Namēwar dārīg
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>ēn māh Ardwahišt ī
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>sāl 3(9) rōzīg
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>rāy ǰaw grīw 3 ō
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>Dādēn ī hammōzag ī
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>ambaragān ēg abāz dād
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>Zādānfarrox āwišt ○
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0406_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Friyag, the manager in Namēwar,
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>on behalf of the ration of this month Ardwahišt (2nd month) of
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>year 3(9)
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>thereupon attributed 3 grīw of barley to
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>Dādēn the person in charge of [6] the *poultry.
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>Zādānfarrox sealed (it).
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>